
    TLXTW2xx scripts are not compatible with Tradewars v1.03x games.  They
    will only work with Tradewars 2002 v2.x.

    Place all files a directory where you want to install the scripts.
    Run SETUP.EXE.

    Let me know if you find any bugs.

